<ul>
    <li><strong>Solo chef</strong> &mdash; ordering, cooking, checking and dishwashing all alone. Fast at first, but once orders pile up a <strong>bottleneck</strong> appears and it is hard to work for long.</li>
    <li><strong>Multi-agent</strong> &mdash; <strong>separate the roles</strong> into ordering, prep, cooking and checking. In parallel at the same time, each focusing on what it does well → it works <strong>long while keeping the quality</strong>.</li>
</ul>

